. Original hosted inspection checked 14,044 source files and 715 distribution entries (313467063 payload bytes; 313722281 archive bytes). Frozen offline inventory has 669 files / 56,452,730 bytes; this is not offline browser execution.\n\nScoped exact-source native observation verified one legal clear/Next, two-step Skip, global search/reselection and reload/Continue. Not ten native clears, measured timing, physical input or human enjoyment evidence. New P01 foundation maps/artwork/Studio are NOT included. This is a labelled technical test build, not whole-Journey validation.\n\nAccepted predecessor v0.66.0 and all older archives must remain available. Separate final package review, immutable publication, Pages public-byte/native acceptance and rollback proof are required. No remote telemetry or manipulative retention systems.\n"}